nagement.","zh":"iikit-08-taskstoissues是一种AI工具，用于将任务转换为依赖排序的GitHub问题","ja":"iikit-08-taskstoissuesは、タスクを依存関係順のGitHub Issueに変換するAIエージェントの一種です","ko":"iikit-08-taskstoissues는 태스크를 의존성 순서의 GitHub 이슈로 변환하는 인공지능 도구입니다","es":"iikit-08-taskstoissues es una herramienta de línea de comandos que convierte tareas en problemas de GitHub","fr":"iikit-08-taskstoissues est un outil en ligne de commande qui convertit des tâches en problèmes GitHub","de":"iikit-08-taskstoissues ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool, das Aufgaben in GitHub-Probleme umwandelt","pt":"O iikit-08-taskstoissues é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que converte tarefas em problemas do GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агент iikit-08-taskstoissues - это командная утилита, преобразующая задачи в проблемы GitHub","ar":"أداة iikit-08-taskstoissues هي أداة سطر أوامر تحول المهام إلى قضايا GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Converts existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues","Utilizes bash scripts for prerequisites checking","Supports JSON data format for seamless integration","Runs on GitHub for project tracking and management","Executes prerequisites check using `check-prerequisites.sh` script","Compatible with Windows using `pwsh` command"],"zh":["支持将任务转换为依赖排序的GitHub问题","使用bash脚本进行环境检查","支持Windows和Linux平台","可以使用CLI进行交互","支持JSON格式的输入输出"],"ja":["タスクを依存関係順のGitHub Issueに変換する機能","bashスクリプトを使用した環境チェック","WindowsとLinuxプラットフォームのサポート","CLIを使用したインタラクティブ操作","JSON形式の入出力のサポート"],"ko":["태스크를 의존성 순서의 GitHub 이슈로 변환하는 기능","bash 스크립트를 사용한 환경 확인","Windows와 Linux 플랫폼의 지원","CLI를 사용한 상호 작용","JSON 형식의 입력 출력 지원"],"es":["Conversión de tareas en problemas de GitHub","Ordenamiento de dependencias para un seguimiento de proyectos más eficaz","Compatibilidad con GitHub para una integración perfecta","Uso de scripts de bash para una configuración flexible","Soporte para Windows y sistemas operativos basados en Unix"],"fr":["Conversion de tâches en problèmes GitHub","Ordre de dépendance pour un suivi de projets plus efficace","Compatibilité avec GitHub pour une intégration parfaite","Utilisation de scripts bash pour une configuration flexible","Prise en charge de Windows et de systèmes d''exploitation basés sur Unix"],"de":["Umwandlung von Aufgaben in GitHub-Probleme","Abhängigkeitsreihenfolge für eine effektivere Projektnachverfolgung","Kompatibilität mit GitHub für eine perfekte Integration","Verwendung von Bash-Skripten für eine flexible Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Windows und Unix-basierte Betriebssysteme"],"pt":["Conversão de tarefas em problemas do GitHub","Utilização de scripts Bash para otimizar o rastreamento de projetos","Suporte a JSON para formatação de dados","Verificação de pré-requisitos com script de bash","Compatibilidade com sistemas operacionais Windows e Linux"],"ru":["Преобразование задач в проблемы GitHub","Использование скриптов Bash для оптимизации отслеживания проектов","Поддержка JSON для форматирования данных","Проверка предварительных требований с помощью скрипта bash","Совместимость с операционными системами Windows и Linux, используя ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تحويل المهام إلى قضايا GitHub","استخدام脚本ات Bash لتحسين تتبع المشاريع","دعم JSON لتنسيق البيانات","فحص المتطلبات المسبقة باستخدام脚本 bash","توافق مع أنظمة التشغيل Windows و Linux وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use iikit-08-taskstoissues","iikit-08-taskstoissues setup guide","iikit-08-taskstoissues alternative","github issue converter","bash script for project tracking","json data format for integration","iikit-08-taskstoissues install","project management with github issues","dependency-ordered issue tracking"],"zh":["AI工具","任务转换","GitHub问题","依赖排序","bash脚本","环境检查","CLI","JSON","项目跟踪"],"ja":["AIエージェント","タスク変換","GitHub Issue","依存関係順","bashスクリプト","環境チェック","CLI","JSON","プロジェクト追跡"],"ko":["인공지능 도구","태스크 변환","GitHub 이슈","의존성 순서","bash 스크립트","환경 확인","CLI","JSON","프로젝트 추적"],"es":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","convertir tareas en problemas de GitHub","seguimiento de proyectos","herramientas de línea de comandos","GitHub","bash","Windows","Unix","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","convertir des tâches en problèmes GitHub","suivi de projets","outils en ligne de commande","GitHub","bash","Windows","Unix","développement de logiciels"],"de":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","Umwandlung von Aufgaben in GitHub-Probleme","Projektnachverfolgung","Kommandozeilentools","GitHub","bash","Windows","Unix","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","conversão de tarefas","problemas do GitHub","scripts Bash","JSON","rastreamento de projetos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","linha de comando"],"ru":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","преобразование задач","проблемы GitHub","скрипты Bash","JSON","отслеживание проектов","инструменты разработки","командная строка","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["iikit-08-taskstoissues","تحويل المهام","قضايا GitHub","脚本ات Bash","JSON","تتبع المشاريع","أدوات تطوير","سطر أوامر","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"intent-integrity-chain","repo":"kit","repoPath":"intent-integrity-chain/kit","stars":14,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T00:08:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iikit-08-taskstoissues","description":">-","version":"1.6.4","bodyPreview":"# Intent Integrity Kit Tasks to Issues\n\nConvert existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues for project tracking.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\n1. Run prerequisites check:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/check-prerequisites.sh --phase 08 --json\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/","body":"# Intent Integrity Kit Tasks to Issues\n\nConvert existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues for project tracking.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\n1. Run prerequisites check:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/check-prerequisites.sh --phase 08 --json\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/check-prerequisites.ps1 -Phase 08 -Json`\n\n2. Parse JSON for `FEATURE_DIR` and `AVAILABLE_DOCS`. Extract path to **tasks.md**.\n3. If JSON contains `needs_selection: true`: present the `features` array as a numbered table (name and stage columns). Follow the options presentation pattern in [conversation-guide.md](../iikit-core/references/conversation-guide.md). After user selects, run:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/set-active-feature.sh --json <selection>\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/set-active-feature.ps1 -Json <selection>`\n\n   Then re-run the prerequisites check from step 1.\n\n## GitHub Remote Validation\n\n```bash\ngit config --get remote.origin.url\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Only proceed if remote is a GitHub URL (`git@github.com:` or `https://github.com/`). Otherwise ERROR.\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### 1. Parse tasks.md\n\nExtract: Task IDs, descriptions, phase groupings, parallel markers [P], user story labels [USn], dependencies.\n\n### 2. Create GitHub Issues\n\n**Title format**: `[FeatureID/TaskID] [Story] Description` — feature-id extracted from `FEATURE_DIR` (e.g. `001-user-auth`).\n\n**Body**: use template from [issue-body-template.md](references/issue-body-template.md). **Labels** (create if needed): `iikit`, `phase-N`, `us-N`, `parallel`.\n\n### 3. Create Issues (parallel)\n\nUse the `Task` tool to dispatch issue creation in parallel — one subagent per chunk of tasks (split by phase or user story). Each subagent receives:\n- The chunk of tasks to create issues for\n- The feature-id, repo owner/name, and label set\n- Instructions to use `gh issue create` if available, otherwise `curl` the GitHub API\n\n```bash\n# Preferred:\ngh issue create --title \"[001-user-auth/T012] [US1] Create User model\" --body \"...\" --label \"iikit,phase-3,us-1\"\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Never create issues in repositories that don''t match the remote URL. Verify before dispatching.\n\nCollect all created issue numbers from subagents. Verify all returned successfully before proceeding. If some failed: report failures, continue with successful issues only.\n\n### 4. Link Dependencies\n\nAfter all issues exist, edit bodies to add cross-references using `#NNN` syntax. Skip dependency links for any issues that failed to create.\n\n## Report\n\nOutput: issues created (count + numbers), failures (count + details), link to repo issues list.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Condition | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Not a GitHub remote | STOP with error |\n| Issue creation fails | Report, continue with remaining issues |\n| Partial failure | Link dependencies for successful issues only |\n\n## Next Steps\n\nRun: `bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/next-step.sh --phase 08 --json`\nWindows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/next-step.ps1 -Phase 08 -Json`\n\nParse the JSON and present:\n1. `next_step` will be null (workflow complete)\n2. If `alt_steps` non-empty: list as alternatives\n3. Append dashboard link\n\nIf on a feature branch, offer to merge:\n- **A) Merge locally**: `git checkout main && git merge <branch>`\n- **B) Create PR**: `gh pr create`\n- **C) Skip**: user will handle it\n\nFormat:\n```\nIssues exported! Review in GitHub, assign team members, add to project boards.\n- Dashboard: file://$(pwd)/.specify/dashboard.html (resolve the path)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:43:50.171Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents needing automated task-to-issue conversion for seamless GitHub integration.","zh":"适合需要自动任务到问题转换以实现无缝 GitHub 集成的项目管理代理。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが自動タスクから問題への変換を必要とする場合に最適です。GitHubとのシームレスな統合が可能です。","ko":"프로젝트 관리 에이전트가 자동 작업에서 문제로의 변환을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 깃허브와의 무결점 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan conversión automática de tarea a problema para una integración perfecta con GitHub.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une conversion automatique de tâche à problème pour une intégration transparente à GitHub.","de":"Ideal für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Aufgabe-zu-Problemmkonvertierung für eine nahtlose GitHub-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de conversão automática de tarefa para problema para integração sem interrupções no GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления проектами, которым требуется автоматическое преобразование задач в проблемы для бесперебойной интеграции с GitHub.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل مهام آلي إلى مشكلة من أجل التكامل السلس مع GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues using bash scripts and JSON data, streamlining project tracking and benefiting developers and project managers through efficient issue management.","zh":"赋予代理人使用bash脚本和JSON数据将现有任务转换为依赖排序的GitHub问题的能力，从而简化项目跟踪，并通过高效的问题管理使开发人员和项目经理受益。","ja":"bashスクリプトとJSONデータを使用して既存のタスクを依存順位付けされたGitHubの問題に変換する能力をエージェントに与え、プロジェクトの追跡を簡素化し、開発者とプロジェクトマネージャーに効率的な問題管理の利点を提供します。","ko":"bash 스크립트와 JSON 데이터를 사용하여 기존 작업을 의존성 순서가 지정된 깃허브 문제로 변환하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 프로젝트 추적을 간소화하고 개발자 및 프로젝트 관리자에게 효율적인 문제 관리의 이점을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir tareas existentes en problemas de GitHub ordenados por dependencia utilizando scripts de bash y datos JSON, lo que simplifica el seguimiento de proyectos y beneficia a los desarrolladores y gestores de proyectos a través de una gestión eficiente de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des tâches existantes en des problèmes GitHub classés par ordre de dépendance à l''aide de scripts bash et de données JSON, ce qui rationalise le suivi des projets et profite aux développeurs et aux gestionnaires de projet grâce à une gestion efficace des problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bestehende Aufgaben in von Abhängigkeiten geordnete GitHub-Probleme mithilfe von Bash-Skripten und JSON-Daten umzuwandeln, wodurch die Projektverfolgung rationalisiert und Entwickler sowie Projektmanager durch effizientes Problemmmanagement profitieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter tarefas existentes em problemas do GitHub ordenados por dependência usando scripts bash e dados JSON, racionalizando o acompanhamento de projetos e beneficiando os desenvolvedores e gerentes de projeto por meio de uma gestão de problemas eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать существующие задачи в проблемы GitHub, упорядоченные по зависимости, с использованием скриптов bash и данных JSON, оптимизируя отслеживание проектов и принося пользу разработчикам и менеджерам проектов за счет эффективного управления проблемами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل المهام الحالية إلى مشاكل GitHub مرتبة بالاعتماد باستخدام البرامج النصية bash وبيانات JSON، وتبسيط تتبع المشروع وتفيد المطورين ومديري المشاريع من خلال إدارة فعالة للمشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task-to-issue conversion for project initiation","Generating dependency-ordered issues for complex project tracking","Integrating GitHub issues with existing task management systems"],"zh":["自动化任务到问题转换以启动项目","为复杂项目跟踪生成依赖排序问题","将GitHub问题与现有任务管理系统集成"],"ja":["プロジェクトの開始のためにタスクから問題への自動変換","複雑なプロジェクトの追跡のための依存順位付けされた問題の生成","GitHubの問題を既存のタスク管理システムと統合"],"ko":["프로젝트 시작을 위한 자동 작업에서 문제로의 변환","복잡한 프로젝트 추적을 위한 의존성 순서가 지정된 문제 생성","깃허브 문제를 기존 작업 관리 시스템과 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la conversión de tarea a problema para la iniciación de proyectos","Generación de problemas ordenados por dependencia para un seguimiento de proyectos complejos","Integración de problemas de GitHub con sistemas de gestión de tareas existentes"],"fr":["Automatisation de la conversion de tâche à problème pour l''initialisation de projets","Génération de problèmes classés par ordre de dépendance pour un suivi de projets complexes","Intégration de problèmes GitHub avec des systèmes de gestion de tâches existants"],"de":["Automatisierung der Umwandlung von Aufgaben in Probleme für die Initiierung von Projekten","Erzeugung von von Abhängigkeiten geordneten Problemen für die Verfolgung komplexer Projekte","Integration von GitHub-Problemen mit bestehenden Aufgabenmanagementsystemen"],"pt":["Automatizar a conversão de tarefa para problema para inicialização do projeto","Gerar problemas ordenados por dependência para acompanhamento de projetos complexos","Integrar problemas do GitHub com sistemas de gerenciamento de tarefas existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать преобразование задач в проблемы для инициализации проекта","Генерировать проблемы, упорядоченные по зависимости, для отслеживания сложных проектов","Интегрировать проблемы GitHub с существующими системами управления задачами"],"ar":["تحويل مهام آلي إلى مشكلة لبدء المشروع","توليد مشاكل مرتبة بالاعتماد لمتابعة مشاريع معقدة","دمج مشاكل GitHub مع أنظمة إدارة المهام الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub integration","Bash script compatibility necessary","JSON data format required for task representation"],"zh":["需要GitHub集成","bash脚本兼容性是必要的","JSON数据格式需要用于任务表示"],"ja":["GitHubの統合が必要","bashスクリプトの互換性が必要","タスクの表現にはJSONデータ形式が必要"],"ko":["깃허브 통합이 필요","bash 스크립트 호환성이 필요","작업 표현을 위해 JSON 데이터 형식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con GitHub","Compatibilidad con scripts de bash necesaria","Formato de datos JSON requerido para la representación de tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration à GitHub","Compatibilité avec les scripts bash nécessaire","Format de données JSON requis pour la représentation des tâches"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Integration","Bash-Skript-Kompatibilität erforderlich","JSON-Datenformat erforderlich für die Darstellung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Requer integração com o GitHub","Compatibilidade com script bash necessária","Formato de dados JSON necessário para representação de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с GitHub","Необходима совместимость со скриптом bash","Требуется формат данных JSON для представления задач"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع GitHub","التوافق مع البرنامج النصي bash ضروري","يتطلب تنسيق بيانات JSON لتمثيل المهام"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8d4f01673ecb8012818d8c70ff6d9e92791a9004853d4e582d2fe7a88b5f696a","qualityScore":50}');
