INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('JanuaryLabs/deepagents/openspec-bulk-archive-change', 'openspec-bulk-archive-change', 'JanuaryLabs', 'deepagents', 'community', 'openspec-bulk-archive-change JanuaryLabs deepagents community The openspec-bulk-archive-change skill allows developers to archive multiple completed changes in a single operation, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase. This skill benefits developers working with large codebases. openspec-bulk-archive-change 是一种批量归档更改的技能，智能处理规格冲突。它允许您批量归档更改，检查代码库以确定实际实现的内容 openspec-bulk-archive-change はバッチ変更のアーカイブを可能にするスキルで、スマートな仕様の衝突を解決します。コードベースをチェックして実際に実装された内容を判断します openspec-bulk-archive-change는 배치 변경 아카이브를 가능하게 하는 스킬로 스마트한 사양 충돌을 해결합니다. 코드베이스를 확인하여 실제로 구현된 내용을 판단합니다 openspec-bulk-archive-change permite archivar múltiples cambios en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificaciones de forma inteligente openspec-bulk-archive-change vous permet d''archiver plusieurs changements en une seule opération, en gérant de manière intelligente les conflits de spécifications openspec-bulk-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren mehrerer Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation, indem es Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent handhabt O openspec-bulk-archive-change é uma habilidade que permite arquivar várias mudanças concluídas em uma única operação, lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente openspec-bulk-archive-change - это навык, который позволяет архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одну операцию, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций интеллектуально openspec-bulk-archive-change هو مهارة تسمح بتحديث عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة، وتتعامل مع конфликات المواصفات بذكاء how to use openspec-bulk-archive-change openspec-bulk-archive-change setup guide openspec-bulk-archive-change alternative what is openspec-bulk-archive-change openspec-bulk-archive-change install batch archiving with openspec-bulk-archive-change openspec-bulk-archive-change vs manual archiving openspec-bulk-archive-change tutorial openspec-bulk-archive-change benefits for developers openspec-bulk-archive-change AI 工具 批量归档更改 智能处理规格冲突 openspec list --json AskUserQuestion 代码库检查 Runs `openspec list --json` to retrieve all active changes Utilizes AskUserQuestion tool for multi-select change selection Checks the codebase to determine implemented changes Handles spec conflicts intelligently Prompts user for change selection with no required input Supports batch archiving of multiple completed changes openspec-bulk-archive-change is a skill that enables batch archiving of completed changes, intelligently resolving spec conflicts by analyzing the codebase.');
