действия Convex","разработка приложений","платформа разработки"],"ar":["Convex تطوير","التطبيقات الردة الفعالة","Functions Convex","Schema Convex","Realtime Convex","HTTP Actions Convex","تطوير التطبيقات","منصة التطوير"]}},"owner":"ElementsAI-Dev","repo":"Cognia","repoPath":"ElementsAI-Dev/Cognia","stars":3,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T03:17:33Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex","description":"Umbrella skill for all Convex development patterns. Use when starting a new Convex project, unsure which specific Convex skill to use, or need an overview of available Convex development skills. Routes to specific skills like convex-functions, convex-realtime, convex-agents, convex-schema-validator, etc.","bodyPreview":"# Convex Development Skills\n\nThis is an index skill for Convex development. Use specific skills for detailed guidance:\n\n## Core Development\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Functions | `/convex-functions` | Writing queries, mutations, actions |\n| Schema | `/convex-schema-validator` | Defining database schemas and validators |\n| Realtime | `/convex-realtime` | Building reactive subscriptions |\n| HTTP Actions | `/convex-http-actions` | Webhooks and HTTP endpoints |","body":"# Convex Development Skills\n\nThis is an index skill for Convex development. Use specific skills for detailed guidance:\n\n## Core Development\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Functions | `/convex-functions` | Writing queries, mutations, actions |\n| Schema | `/convex-schema-validator` | Defining database schemas and validators |\n| Realtime | `/convex-realtime` | Building reactive subscriptions |\n| HTTP Actions | `/convex-http-actions` | Webhooks and HTTP endpoints |\n\n## Data & Storage\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| File Storage | `/convex-file-storage` | File uploads, serving, storage |\n| Migrations | `/convex-migrations` | Schema evolution, data backfills |\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Agents | `/convex-agents` | Building AI agents with tools |\n| Cron Jobs | `/convex-cron-jobs` | Scheduled background tasks |\n| Components | `/convex-component-authoring` | Reusable Convex packages |\n\n## Security\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Security Check | `/convex-security-check` | Quick security audit checklist |\n| Security Audit | `/convex-security-audit` | Deep security review |\n\n## Guidelines\n\n| Skill | Command | Use When |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Best Practices | `/convex-best-practices` | General patterns and guidelines |\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor most tasks:\n1. Start with `/convex-best-practices` for general patterns\n2. Use `/convex-functions` for writing backend logic\n3. Use `/convex-schema-validator` for data modeling\n4. Use specific skills as needed for your use case\n\n## Documentation\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev\n- LLM-optimized: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:06:52.650Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents requiring scalable and real-time application development with Convex","zh":"适用于需要使用Convex进行可扩展和实时应用开发的全栈代理","ja":"Convexを使用したスケーラブルでリアルタイムのアプリケーション開発を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています","ko":"Convex를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 실시간 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Full-Stack que requieren desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y en tiempo real con Convex","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant un développement d''applications évolutif et en temps réel avec Convex","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine skalierbare und Echtzeit-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Convex erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que requerem desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis e em tempo real com Convex","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full-Stack, требующих масштабируемого и реального времени разработки приложений с Convex","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخزين الكامل الذي يتطلب تطوير تطبيقات قابل للتحجيم ووقت حقيقي مع Convex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build robust applications with core development capabilities, including functions, schema validation using Convex Schema Validator, and real-time subscriptions with Convex Realtime, all while leveraging HTTP Actions for webhooks and endpoints","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的应用程序的能力，包括使用Convex Schema Validator进行函数、模式验证以及使用Convex Realtime进行实时订阅等核心开发能力，同时利用HTTP Actions进行Webhook和端点","ja":"Convex Schema Validatorを使用した関数、スキーマの検証、およびConvex Realtimeを使用したリアルタイムのサブスクリプションなど、コア開発機能を使用して強力なアプリケーションを構築するエージェントを可能にします。また、HTTP Actionsを使用してWebhookとエンドポイントも利用できます","ko":"Convex Schema Validator를 사용한 함수, 스키마 유효성 검사 및 Convex Realtime를 사용한 실시간 구독 등의 핵심 개발 기능을 사용하여 강력한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, HTTP Actions를 사용하여 Webhook와 엔드포인트도 활용할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones robustas con capacidades de desarrollo central, incluyendo funciones, validación de esquemas utilizando Convex Schema Validator y suscripciones en tiempo real con Convex Realtime, todo mientras aprovecha las Acciones HTTP para webhooks y puntos finales","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications robustes avec des capacités de développement central, notamment des fonctions, une validation de schémas à l''aide de Convex Schema Validator et des abonnements en temps réel avec Convex Realtime, le tout en exploitant les Actions HTTP pour les webhooks et les points de terminaison","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, robuste Anwendungen mit Kern-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten zu bauen, einschließlich Funktionen, Schemavalidierung mit Convex Schema Validator und Echtzeit-Abonnements mit Convex Realtime, alles unter Ausnutzung von HTTP-Aktionen für Webhooks und Endpunkte","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações robustas com capacidades de desenvolvimento core, incluindo funções, validação de esquema usando Convex Schema Validator, e assinaturas em tempo real com Convex Realtime, tudo isso aproveitando Ações HTTP para webhooks e endpoints","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные приложения с ядром возможностей разработки, включая функции, валидацию схемы с помощью Convex Schema Validator, и подписки в реальном времени с Convex Realtime, все это при помощи HTTP-действий для вебхуков и конечных точек","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات قوية مع قدرات تطويرية أساسية، بما في ذلك الوظائف، وتصديق مخطط باستخدام Convex Schema Validator، والاشتراكات في الوقت الفعلي مع Convex Realtime، مع استخدام إجراءات HTTP لويب هوك ونقاط النهاية"},"useCases":{"en":["Building reactive subscriptions with Convex Realtime","Defining and validating database schemas using Convex Schema Validator","Writing efficient queries, mutations, and actions with Convex Functions"],"zh":["使用Convex Realtime构建响应式订阅","使用Convex Schema Validator定义和验证数据库模式","使用Convex Functions编写高效的查询、变异和操作"],"ja":["Convex Realtimeを使用してリアクティブなサブスクリプションを構築する","Convex Schema Validatorを使用してデータベーススキーマを定義および検証する","Convex Functionsを使用して効率的なクエリ、ミューテーション、アクションを記述する"],"ko":["Convex Realtime를 사용하여 반응형 구독을 구축하는 것","Convex Schema Validator를 사용하여 데이터베이스 스키마를 정의 및 유효성 검사하는 것","Convex Functions를 사용하여 효율적인 쿼리, 변이, 액션을 작성하는 것"],"es":["Construir suscripciones reactivas con Convex Realtime","Definir y validar esquemas de base de datos utilizando Convex Schema Validator","Escribir consultas, mutaciones y acciones eficientes con Convex Functions"],"fr":["Construire des abonnements réactifs avec Convex Realtime","Définir et valider les schémas de base de données à l''aide de Convex Schema Validator","Écrire des requêtes, des mutations et des actions efficaces avec Convex Functions"],"de":["Reaktive Abonnements mit Convex Realtime aufbauen","Datenbankschemata mit Convex Schema Validator definieren und validieren","Effiziente Abfragen, Mutationen und Aktionen mit Convex Functions schreiben"],"pt":["Construir assinaturas reativas com Convex Realtime","Definir e validar esquemas de banco de dados usando Convex Schema Validator","Escrever consultas, mutações e ações eficientes com Convex Functions"],"ru":["Построение реактивных подписок с Convex Realtime","Определение и проверка схем базы данных с помощью Convex Schema Validator","Написание эффективных запросов, мутаций и действий с помощью Convex Functions"],"ar":["بناء اشتراكات تفاعلية مع Convex Realtime","تحديد وتصديق مخططات قواعد البيانات باستخدام Convex Schema Validator","كتابة استفسارات، طفرات، وإجراءات فعالة مع Convex Functions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex development framework","Specific to Convex core development and real-time capabilities"],"zh":["需要Convex开发框架","特定于Convex核心开发和实时功能"],"ja":["Convex開発フレームワークが必要","Convexコア開発およびリアルタイム機能に特有"],"ko":["Convex 개발 프레임워크가 필요함","Convex 핵심 개발 및 실시간 기능에 특정"],"es":["Requiere el marco de desarrollo Convex","Específico para el desarrollo central y las capacidades en tiempo real de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework de développement Convex","Spécifique au développement central et aux capacités en temps réel de Convex"],"de":["Erfordert das Convex-Entwicklungsframework","Spezifisch für die Kern-Entwicklung und die Echtzeit-Fähigkeiten von Convex"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de desenvolvimento Convex","Específico para desenvolvimento core e capacidades em tempo real do Convex"],"ru":["Требует框架 разработки Convex","Конкретно для ядра разработки и возможностей реального времени Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار عمل تطوير Convex","محدد لتطوير_core و قدرات الوقت الفعلي من Convex"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0a0fb49cfe7a70326830ccdc9c623ff40befdb91273b9291d6544573a3e2fa66","qualityScore":50}');
