INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('fkoschi/grind-it/openspec-continue-change', 'openspec-continue-change', 'fkoschi', 'grind-it', 'community', 'openspec-continue-change fkoschi grind-it community The openspec-continue-change skill allows developers to continue working on a change by creating the next artifact, streamlining their workflow. It benefits developers by providing an efficient way to manage changes. openspec-continue-change 技术允许您继续更改工作流，使用 openspec list 和 AskUserQuestion 工具 openspec-continue-change 技術は、openspec list と AskUserQuestion ツールを使用して変更を続行することができます openspec-continue-change 기술을 사용하여 openspec list 및 AskUserQuestion 도구로 변경을 계속할 수 있습니다 openspec-continue-change permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en cambios mediante la creación de artefactos. Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion para seleccionar cambios. openspec-continue-change permet aux développeurs de poursuivre le travail sur les modifications en créant des artefacts. Il utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion pour sélectionner les modifications. openspec-continue-change ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Änderungen fortzusetzen, indem sie Artefakte erstellen. Es verwendet das AskUserQuestion-Tool, um Änderungen auszuwählen. O openspec-continue-change é uma ferramenta que permite criar artefatos facilmente. Ele usa comandos CLI e ferramentas de usuário para melhorar a produtividade. openspec-continue-change — это инструмент, который позволяет создавать артефакты легко. Он использует команды CLI и инструменты пользователя для повышения производительности. openspec-continue-change هو أداة تمكنك من إنشاء الملفات المطلوبة بسهولة. يستخدم أوامر CLI وأدوات المستخدم لتحسين الإنتاجية. how to use openspec-continue-change openspec-continue-change setup guide openspec-continue-change alternative openspec-continue-change vs git openspec-continue-change install what is openspec-continue-change openspec-continue-change tutorial openspec-continue-change best practices openspec-continue-change AIエージェント openspec list AskUserQuestion 继续更改工作流 CLI 技术 Runs openspec list --json to get available changes sorted by most recently modified Utilizes the AskUserQuestion tool to let users select which change to work on Presents the top 3-5 available changes for user selection Optionally accepts a change name as input Infers the change name from conversation context if not provided Prompts for selection if the change name is vague or ambiguous openspec-continue-change is a skill that enables developers to continue working on a change by creating the next artifact, using commands like openspec list --json to get available changes.');
