automate-process is a Spring Boot and Kotlin example service using Zeebe for process orchestration, generating necessary code for automating BPMN processes.","zh":"automate-process 是一种使用 Zeebe 和 Kotlin 实现流程自动化的技能","ja":"automate-process は、Zeebe と Kotlin を使用したプロセス自動化を実現するスキルです","ko":"automate-process는 Zeebe 및 Kotlin을 사용하여 프로세스 자동화를 구현하는 스킬입니다","es":"Automate-process es un skill que genera código para automatizar procesos BPMN con Zeebe y Kotlin","fr":"Automate-process est un skill qui génère du code pour automatiser des processus BPMN avec Zeebe et Kotlin","de":"Automate-process ist ein Skill, der Code für die Automatisierung von BPMN-Prozessen mit Zeebe und Kotlin generiert","pt":"O que é Automate-Process? É um serviço que gera código de glue para automatizar processos Zeebe BPMN","ru":"Что такое Автоматизация Процессов? Это сервис, генерирующий код для автоматизации процессов Zeebe BPMN","ar":"ما هو Automate-Process؟ إنه خدمة تولد كود لربط العمليات Zeebe BPMN"},"features":{"en":["Generates job workers stored in `adapter/inbound/zeebe` with one `@JobWorker` per serviceTask","Creates process out-adapter and inbound/outbound port interfaces","Supports application service stubs generation","Utilizes Zeebe for process orchestration","Built with Spring Boot and Kotlin for seamless integration","Follows hexagonal-architecture principles for maintainable code"],"zh":["生成 hexagonal-architecture 粘合代码","自动化 Zeebe BPMN 流程","使用 Spring Boot 和 Kotlin 实现","包括 job 工作器、进程出适配器、入站/出站端口接口和应用服务存根","支持 Zeebe 的过程编排"],"ja":["hexagonal-architecture 粘合コードを生成する","Zeebe BPMN プロセスの自動化","Spring Boot と Kotlin を使用して実現","ジョブ ワーカー、プロセス出アダプター、入力/出力ポート インターフェイス、アプリケーション サービス スタブを含む","Zeebe のプロセス オーケストレーションをサポート"],"ko":["hexagonal-architecture胶合 코드 생성","Zeebe BPMN 프로세스의 자동화","Spring Boot 및 Kotlin을 사용하여 구현","작업 작업자, 프로세스 아웃 어댑터, 인바운드/아웃바운드 포트 인터페이스 및 애플리케이션 서비스 스텁 포함","Zeebe의 프로세스 오케스트레이션 지원"],"es":["Generación de código para procesos BPMN con Zeebe","Integración con Spring Boot y Kotlin","Arquitectura hexagonal para procesos automatizados","Soporte para job workers y adaptadores de proceso","Generación de interfaz de puertos de entrada y salida"],"fr":["Génération de code pour les processus BPMN avec Zeebe","Intégration avec Spring Boot et Kotlin","Architecture hexagonale pour les processus automatisés","Prise en charge des job workers et des adaptateurs de processus","Génération de l''interface de ports d''entrée et de sortie"],"de":["Code-Generierung für BPMN-Prozesse mit Zeebe","Integration mit Spring Boot und Kotlin","Hexagonale Architektur für automatisierte Prozesse","Unterstützung für Job-Worker und Prozess-Adaptoren","Generierung von Schnittstellen für Eingangs- und Ausgangs-Ports"],"pt":["Geração de código de glue para processos Zeebe BPMN","Suporte a arquitetura hexagonal","Integração com Spring Boot e Kotlin","Criação de job workers e adaptadores de processo","Geração de interfaces de porta de entrada e saída"],"ru":["Генерация кода для автоматизации процессов Zeebe BPMN","Поддержка шестиугольной архитектуры","Интеграция с Spring Boot и Kotlin","Создание рабочих процессов и адаптеров процесса","Генерация интерфейсов входных и выходных портов"],"ar":["توليد كود لربط العمليات Zeebe BPMN","دعم هندسة سداسية","تكامل مع Spring Boot و Kotlin","إنشاء عمال وظيفة وملحقات عملية","توليد واجهات منفذ الدخول والخروج"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use automate-process","what is automate-process","automate-process alternative","automate-process vs Camunda","automate-process install","automate-process setup guide","Zeebe BPMN process automation","Spring Boot automate-process","Kotlin automate-process example","automate-process workflow automation"],"zh":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","hexagonal-architecture","BPMN","流程自动化","AIエージェント","Zeebe BPMN"],"ja":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","hexagonal-architecture","BPMN","プロセス自動化","AIエージェント","Zeebe BPMN"],"ko":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","hexagonal-architecture","BPMN","프로세스 자동화","AI 에이전트","Zeebe BPMN"],"es":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","BPMN","arquitectura hexagonal","procesos automatizados","job workers","adaptadores de proceso"],"fr":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","BPMN","architecture hexagonale","processus automatisés","job workers","adaptateurs de processus"],"de":["automate-process","Zeebe","Kotlin","Spring Boot","BPMN","hexagonale Architektur","automatisierte Prozesse","Job-Worker","Prozess-Adaptoren"],"pt":["automate-process","zeebe","kotlin","spring boot","arquitetura hexagonal","processos bpmn","job workers","adaptadores de processo"],"ru":["автоматизация процессов","zeebe","kotlin","spring boot","шестиугольная архитектура","процессы bpmn","рабочие процессы","адаптеры процесса","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ال Automate-Process","zeebe","kotlin","spring boot","هندسة سداسية","عمليات bpmn","عمال وظيفة","ملحقات عملية","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"emaarco","repo":"easy-zeebe","repoPath":"emaarco/easy-zeebe","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T07:29:30Z","topics":["bpmn","kotlin","spring","zeebe"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"automate-process","description":"Generate full hexagonal glue-code for a Zeebe BPMN process across all five layers — inbound workers, inbound/outbound port interfaces, application services, and a process out-adapter. Use when the user asks to automate a process, generate glue-code for a BPMN process, or scaffold workers and adapters. Accepts a ProcessApi file, a BPMN model, or a plain description; skips files that already exist; optionally runs the review-process audit first.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: automate-process\n\nGenerate full hexagonal-architecture glue-code for automating a Zeebe BPMN process:\njob workers, process out-adapter, inbound/outbound port interfaces, and application service stubs.\n\n## What This Skill Creates\n\n// TODO: use a list instead of a layer like\n\n- Inbound Workers: stored in `adapter/inbound/zeebe` with one `@JobWorker` per serviceTask\n\n| Layer                | Location                     | What                                     |\n|----------------------|-","body":"# Skill: automate-process\n\nGenerate full hexagonal-architecture glue-code for automating a Zeebe BPMN process:\njob workers, process out-adapter, inbound/outbound port interfaces, and application service stubs.\n\n## What This Skill Creates\n\n// TODO: use a list instead of a layer like\n\n- Inbound Workers: stored in `adapter/inbound/zeebe` with one `@JobWorker` per serviceTask\n\n| Layer                | Location                     | What                                     |\n|----------------------|------------------------------|------------------------------------------|\n| Inbound workers      | `adapter/inbound/zeebe/`     | One `@JobWorker` class per service task  |\n| Outbound adapter     | `adapter/outbound/zeebe/`    | One process out-adapter class            |\n| Inbound ports        | `application/port/inbound/`  | One use-case interface per worker        |\n| Outbound port        | `application/port/outbound/` | One process port interface               |\n| Application services | `application/service/`       | One service class per use-case interface |\n\nThe adapter and worker files reference these interfaces so the hexagonal wiring is complete from the start.\n\n## IMPORTANT\n\n**All string constants must come from the ProcessApi — never use raw string literals.**\n\n- Worker `@JobWorker(type = ...)` → `ProcessApi.TaskTypes.CONSTANT`\n- Adapter `startProcess(processId = ...)` → `ProcessApi.PROCESS_ID`\n- Adapter `sendMessage(messageName = ...)` → `ProcessApi.Messages.CONSTANT`\n- Variable keys → `ProcessApi.Variables.CONSTANT` where defined\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Preparation – Validate the BPMN model first\n\nBefore generating any code, ask the user whether he has already performed the `review-process` subagent - and ask him\nwhether you should do it. This is very useful, to only generate code for clean processes that follow the styleguide.\n\nIf the user agrees to running the subagent, then start it, but terminate the execution of this skill. Tell the user to\nwait until the `review-process` agent is done.\n\nAfter that he must fully restart the `automate-process` once again\nIf he disagrees to perform the `review` agent, continue with step 1.\n\n### Step 1 – Resolve the input source\n\nDetermine where the process constants come from based on `$ARGUMENTS`:\n\n- **ProcessApi file (`.kt`)**: read it directly. Extract: package name, object name, `PROCESS_ID`, all `TaskTypes.*`,\n  `Messages.*`, `Signals.*` (if present), and `Variables.*` constants.\n- **BPMN file (`.bpmn`)**: search the same service module for a `*ProcessApi.kt` file (Glob\n  `**/adapter/process/*ProcessApi.kt`). If found, read it as above. If not found, ask the user whether to continue\n  without type-safe constants.\n- **No argument / plain description**: search the whole codebase for `*ProcessApi.kt` files (Glob\n  `**/adapter/process/*ProcessApi.kt`). List them and ask the user which one to use.\n\nIf you can''t find a ProcessApi, pause the execution of the skill, and ask the user to generate one first.\n\n### Step 2 – Determine packages and source root\n\nDerive the base package from the ProcessApi package. Example:\n\n- ProcessApi: `io.miragon.example.adapter.process`\n- Base: `io.miragon.example`\n- Inbound workers: `<base>.adapter.inbound.zeebe`\n- Outbound adapter: `<base>.adapter.outbound.zeebe`\n- Inbound ports: `<base>.application.port.inbound`\n- Outbound port: `<base>.application.port.outbound`\n- Services: `<base>.application.service`\n\n### Step 2.5 – Discover existing domain types\n\nBefore generating any port or adapter code, scan the domain package (`<base>.domain`) for existing value objects.\n\nFor each `Variables.*` constant in the ProcessApi:\n\n- Derive a candidate domain type name by converting the constant to PascalCase\n  (e.g. `NEWSLETTER_ID` → `NewsletterId`, `SUBSCRIPTION_ID` → `SubscriptionId`)\n- If a variable name makes no sense as a domain type name, ask the developer for feedback\n- Check if a file with that name exists under `**/domain/<TypeName>.kt`\n- If found, read it and note the class name and its primary constructor parameter type (typically `UUID` or `String`)\n\nIf no suitable domain type exists for a variable, **create one** (a Kotlin `data class` wrapping `UUID` or `String`,\nwith a secondary `String` constructor when the primary wraps `UUID`) **before** generating ports or adapters.\n\n### Step 3 – Generate inbound port interfaces (use cases)\n\nFor each `TaskTypes.*` constant, generate a use-case interface. Name convention: derive a meaningful interface name from\nthe task type constant (e.g. `NEWSLETTER_ABORT_REGISTRATION` → `AbortSubscriptionUseCase`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- Interface with one method matching the worker''s action\n- Method parameters must use domain types discovered in Step 2.5 — never raw `String` or `UUID`\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 4 – Generate outbound port interface\n\nGenerate one outbound port interface for the process. Name convention: derive from the process name (e.g.\n`NewsletterSubscription` → `NewsletterSubscriptionProcess`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- `startProcess` method (returns `Long`) — or a message-send method if the process uses a message start event\n- One method per `Messages.*` constant\n- All method parameters use domain types discovered in Step 2.5\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 5 – Generate application services\n\nFor each inbound use-case interface, generate an application service implementing it. Name convention: append `Service`\nto the use-case name (e.g. `AbortSubscriptionUseCase` → `AbortSubscriptionService`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- `@Service` class implementing the use-case interface\n- `override fun` with domain type parameters (matching the use-case interface) and `TODO(\"Add implementation\")` body\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 6 – Generate workers (with use-case injection)\n\nSame as `/create-worker` Step 3, but inject the generated use-case interface as the constructor parameter instead of\na placeholder. Apply the same `@Variable` / `@VariableAsType` guidance from that step.\n\nWorker `handle` method parameters must be **primitive types** (`UUID`, `String`) annotated with `@Variable`;\nconvert them to domain types inside the body before calling the use case\n(e.g. `useCase.handle(NewsletterId(newsletterId))`).\n\n### Step 7 – Generate process out-adapter (implementing outbound port)\n\nSame as `/create-process-adapter` Step 3, but add `: ProcessNameProcess` to the class declaration so it implements the\noutbound port interface. Mark each method with `override`.\n\nAdapter methods must accept **domain types** as parameters. Inside the method body, extract the primitive value\n(e.g. `id.value.toString()`) before passing to `engineApi.startProcess` / `engineApi.sendMessage`.\n\n### Step 8 – Report\n\nList every file created or skipped. Remind the developer to:\n\n1. Run `/test-worker` for each worker\n2. Run `/test-process-adapter` for the adapter\n3. Run `/test-process` to generate process integration tests\n\nOffer to run these test-generation commands right away."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:13:20.728Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Spring Boot and Kotlin developers needing automated Zeebe BPMN process integration.","zh":"适合需要自动化Zeebe BPMN流程集成的Spring Boot和Kotlin开发者。","ja":"Spring BootとKotlinを使用してZeebe BPMNプロセスを自動化する必要がある開発者に最適です。","ko":"Zeebe BPMN 프로세스 자동화가 필요한 Spring Boot 및 Kotlin 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de Spring Boot y Kotlin que necesitan integración de procesos Zeebe BPMN automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs Spring Boot et Kotlin ayant besoin d''une intégration de processus Zeebe BPMN automatisée.","de":"Ideal für Spring Boot- und Kotlin-Entwickler, die eine automatisierte Zeebe-BPMN-Prozessintegration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores Spring Boot e Kotlin que necessitam de integração automática de processos Zeebe BPMN.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков Spring Boot и Kotlin, которым необходима автоматизированная интеграция процессов Zeebe BPMN.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري Spring Boot و Kotlin الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج تلقائي لعمليات Zeebe BPMN."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate full hexagonal-architecture glue-code for automating Zeebe BPMN processes, creating job workers, process out-adapters, and application service stubs using Kotlin and Spring Boot, leveraging protocols like BPMN and frameworks like Zeebe.","zh":"赋予代理人生成用于自动化Zeebe BPMN流程的完整六角架构粘合代码的能力，使用Kotlin和Spring Boot创建作业工作者、流程出适配器和应用服务存根，利用BPMN和Zeebe等协议以及框架。","ja":"エージェントがZeebe BPMNプロセスの自動化に使用される完全な六角形アーキテクチャのグルーコードを生成できるようにし、KotlinとSpring Bootを使用してジョブワーカー、プロセスアウトアダプタ、アプリケーションサービススタブを作成し、BPMNやZeebeなどのプロトコルやフレームワークを利用する。","ko":"Zeebe BPMN 프로세스 자동화를 위한 완전한 六角형 아키텍처 글루 코드 생성을 가능하게 해 주어, Kotlin 및 Spring Boot를 사용하여 작업자, 프로세스 아웃 어댑터, 애플리케이션 서비스 스텁을 생성하며, BPMN 및 Zeebe와 같은 프로토콜 및 프레임워크를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar código de pegamento de arquitectura hexagonal completo para automatizar procesos Zeebe BPMN, crear trabajadores de tareas, adaptadores de salida de procesos y stubs de servicio de aplicaciones utilizando Kotlin y Spring Boot, aprovechando protocolos como BPMN y frameworks como Zeebe.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un code de colle d''architecture hexagonale complet pour automatiser les processus Zeebe BPMN, créer des travailleurs de tâches, des adaptateurs de sortie de processus et des stubs de service d''application en utilisant Kotlin et Spring Boot, en exploitant des protocoles comme BPMN et des frameworks comme Zeebe.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vollständigen Klebstoff-Code für hexagonale Architektur zu generieren, um Zeebe-BPMN-Prozesse zu automatisieren, Job-Worker zu erstellen, Prozess-Ausgangsadapter und Anwendungsservice-Stubs mit Kotlin und Spring Boot zu verwenden, Protokolle wie BPMN und Frameworks wie Zeebe zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de cola de arquitetura hexagonal completa para automatizar processos Zeebe BPMN, criar trabalhadores de serviço, adaptadores de saída de processo e stubs de serviço de aplicação usando Kotlin e Spring Boot, aproveitando protocolos como BPMN e frameworks como Zeebe.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полный код колла гексагональной архитектуры для автоматизации процессов Zeebe BPMN, создания рабочих процессов служб, адаптеров выхода процесса и заглушек сервиса приложения с помощью Kotlin и Spring Boot, используя протоколы như BPMN и фреймворки как Zeebe.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توليد 코드 لاصق كامل لهندسة سداسية لتحسين عمليات Zeebe BPMN، وخلق عمال مهام، وواجهات منفذ دخول وخروج للتحكم في العمليات، باستخدام Kotlin و Spring Boot، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل BPMN و أطر مثل Zeebe."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating business processes with Zeebe BPMN","Generating job workers for service tasks","Creating inbound and outbound port interfaces for process integration"],"zh":["使用Zeebe BPMN自动化业务流程","为服务任务生成作业工作者","为流程集成创建入站和出站端口接口"],"ja":["Zeebe BPMNを使用してビジネスプロセスを自動化する","サービスタスクのジョブワーカーを生成する","プロセス統合のためのインバウンドおよびアウトバウンドポートインターフェイスを作成する"],"ko":["Zeebe BPMN을 사용하여 비즈니스 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","서비스 작업을 위한 작업자 생성","프로세스 통합을 위한 인바운드 및 아웃바운드 포트 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Automatización de procesos empresariales con Zeebe BPMN","Generación de trabajadores de tareas para tareas de servicio","Creación de interfaces de puertos de entrada y salida para integración de procesos"],"fr":["Automatisation de processus métier avec Zeebe BPMN","Génération de travailleurs de tâches pour les tâches de service","Création d''interfaces de ports d''entrée et de sortie pour l''intégration de processus"],"de":["Automatisierung von Geschäftsprozessen mit Zeebe BPMN","Generierung von Job-Workern für Service-Aufgaben","Erstellung von Schnittstellen für Eingangs- und AusgangsPorts für Prozessintegration"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de negócios com Zeebe BPMN","Gerar trabalhadores de serviço para tarefas","Criar interfaces de porta de entrada e saída para integração de processos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать бизнес-процессы с помощью Zeebe BPMN","Генерировать рабочих процессов служб для задач","Создавать входные и выходные интерфейсы портов для интеграции процессов"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات الأعمال مع Zeebe BPMN","توليد عمال مهام لخدمات","خلق واجهات منفذ دخول وخروج للتحكم في العمليات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zeebe BPMN process setup","Limited to Spring Boot and Kotlin ecosystems","Needs specific dependencies for hexagonal-architecture glue-code generation"],"zh":["需要Zeebe BPMN流程设置","仅限Spring Boot和Kotlin生态系统","需要特定的依赖项来生成六角架构粘合代码"],"ja":["Zeebe BPMNプロセスの設定が必要","Spring BootとKotlinのエコシステムのみに限定される","六角形アーキテクチャのグルーコードを生成するために特定の依存関係が必要"],"ko":["Zeebe BPMN 프로세스 설정이 필요","Spring Boot 및 Kotlin 생태계에만 제한","육각형 아키텍처 글루 코드 생성을 위해 특정 종속성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proceso Zeebe BPMN","Limitado a los ecosistemas Spring Boot y Kotlin","Necesita dependencias específicas para la generación de código de pegamento de arquitectura hexagonal"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de processus Zeebe BPMN","Limité aux écosystèmes Spring Boot et Kotlin","Nécessite des dépendances spécifiques pour la génération de code de colle d''architecture hexagonale"],"de":["Benötigt Zeebe-BPMN-Prozesskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Spring Boot- und Kotlin-Ökosysteme","Benötigt spezifische Abhängigkeiten für die Generierung von Klebstoff-Code für hexagonale Architektur"],"pt":["Requer configuração de processo Zeebe BPMN","Limitado aos ecossistemas Spring Boot e Kotlin","Necessita de dependências específicas para geração de código de cola de arquitetura hexagonal"],"ru":["Требует настройки процесса Zeebe BPMN","Ограничен экосистемами Spring Boot и Kotlin","Требует специальных зависимостей для генерации кода колла гексагональной архитектуры"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد عملية Zeebe BPMN","محدود بنطاقات Spring Boot و Kotlin","يحتاج إلى التبعيات المحددة لتوليد代码 لاصق هندسة سداسية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d14e88d4a1648c100e0ac5200840a34364cad5ab9187d1757e386ee9012cbbdb","qualityScore":50}');
