INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('felix-howard/ella/ck:skill-creator', 'ck:skill-creator', 'felix-howard', 'ella', 'community', 'ck:skill-creator felix-howard ella community The ck:skill-creator skill enables developers to create practical instructions for Claude, teaching it how to perform tasks. It utilizes progressive disclosure, activating skills based on metadata quality. CK:SKILL-CREATOR是一种创建高效AI技能的工具，通过进阶披露，优化benchmark性能 CK:SKILL-CREATORは、AIエージェントのスキルを作成し、ベンチマークを最適化するためのツールで、進歩的開示により高いパフォーマンスを実現する CK:SKILL-CREATOR는 효율적인 AI 스킬을 생성하고 벤치마크 성능을 최적화하는 도구로, 진행식 공개를 통해 높은 성능을 구현한다 ck:skill-creator es una habilidad que permite crear instrucciones prácticas para Agentes de IA, utilizando la técnica de divulgación progresiva ck:skill-creator est une compétence qui permet de créer des instructions pratiques pour les Outils d''IA, en utilisant la technique de divulgation progressive ck:skill-creator ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung praktischer Anweisungen für KI-Tools ermöglicht, unter Verwendung der Technik der progressiven Offenlegung O ck:skill-creator é uma habilidade que permite criar instruções práticas para Ferramentas de IA, utilizando progressive disclosure para otimizar o desempenho ИИ Агенты с ck:skill-creator: создание практических инструкций для ИИ Агентов с помощью progressive disclosure الـ ck:skill-creator هو مهارة تسمح بإنشاء تعليمات عملية لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام الكشف التدريجي لتحسين الأداء how to use ck:skill-creator ck:skill-creator setup guide what is ck:skill-creator ck:skill-creator alternative ck:skill-creator vs other AI skills progressive disclosure in AI skills creating benchmark-optimized Claude skills ck:skill-creator install ck:skill-creator tutorial CK:SKILL-CREATOR AI技能创建 benchmark优化 进阶披露 Metadata SKILL.md Bundled资源 AI开发 AIエンジニア Creates practical instructions for Claude, not documentation Utilizes progressive disclosure to activate skills based on metadata quality Supports multiple skills activation automatically Follows a structured approach: Metadata → SKILL.md → Bundled resources Enforces a description limit of <200 characters for clarity ck:skill-creator is a skill that enables the creation of effective, benchmark-optimized Claude skills using progressive disclosure, focusing on practical instructions rather than documentation.');
