етаданных и структурированной информации из 75+ форматов файлов","Поддержка Python, Node.js/TypeScript, Ruby, Go, Java, C#, PHP и Elixir","Ядро Rust для высокопроизводительной работы","Использование через CLI, REST API или сервер MCP","Поддержка OCR для изображений и оцифрованных документов","Извлечение таблиц и изображений из документов"],"ar":["استخراج النص والبيانات الوصفية والمعلومات المنظمة من 75+ تنسيقًا للملفات","دعم Python و Node.js/TypeScript و Ruby و Go و Java و C# و PHP و Elixir","نواة Rust لأداء عالي","استخدام عبر CLI و REST API أو خادم MCP","دعم OCR لصور المستندات والمستندات الرقمية","استخراج الجداول والصور من المستندات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use kreuzberg","kreuzberg alternative","kreuzberg install","document extraction software","kreuzberg vs tesseract","kreuzberg setup guide","polyglot document intelligence","rust document extraction","kreuzberg python binding"],"zh":["Kreuzberg 文档智能框架","文档解析","文档提取","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","AIエージェント","文档智能"],"ja":["Kreuzberg ドキュメントインテリジェンスフレームワーク","ドキュメント解析","ドキュメント抽出","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","AIエージェント","ドキュメントインテリジェンス"],"ko":["Kreuzberg 문서 인텔리전스 프레임워크","문서 파싱","문서 추출","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","AI 도구","문서 인텔리전스"],"es":["Kreuzberg","inteligencia de documentos","extracción de texto","metadatos","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","Go","PHP","Elixir","C#","TypeScript","CLI","REST API","MCP","reconocimiento óptico de caracteres"],"fr":["Kreuzberg","intelligence de documents","extraction de texte","métadonnées","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","Go","PHP","Elixir","C#","TypeScript","CLI","REST API","MCP","reconnaissance optique de caractères"],"de":["Kreuzberg","Dokumentenintelligenz","Textextraktion","Metadaten","Rust","Python","Ruby","Java","Go","PHP","Elixir","C#","TypeScript","CLI","REST-API","MCP","optische Zeichenerkennung"],"pt":["Kreuzberg","inteligência de documentos","extração de texto","metadados","informações estruturadas","Python","Node.js","TypeScript","Ruby","Go","Java","C#","PHP","Elixir","OCR","CLI","REST API","servidor MCP"],"ru":["Kreuzberg","ИИ Агент","интеллектуальное извлечение документов","извлечение текста","метаданные","структурированная информация","Python","Node.js","TypeScript","Ruby","Go","Java","C#","PHP","Elixir","OCR","CLI","REST API","сервер MCP"],"ar":["Kreuzberg","ذكاء المستندات","استخراج النص","البيانات الوصفية","المعلومات المنظمة","Python","Node.js","TypeScript","Ruby","Go","Java","C#","PHP","Elixir","OCR","CLI","REST API","خادم MCP"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"kreuzberg","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/kreuzberg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kreuzberg","description":">-","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Kreuzberg Document Extraction\n\nKreuzberg is a high-performance document intelligence library with a Rust core and native bindings for Python, Node.js/TypeScript, Ruby, Go, Java, C#, PHP, and Elixir. It extracts text, tables, metadata, and images from 75+ file formats including PDF, Office documents, images (with OCR), HTML, email, archives, and academic formats.\n\nUse this skill when writing code that:\n- Extracts text or metadata from documents\n- Performs OCR on scanned documents or images\n- Ba","body":"# Kreuzberg Document Extraction\n\nKreuzberg is a high-performance document intelligence library with a Rust core and native bindings for Python, Node.js/TypeScript, Ruby, Go, Java, C#, PHP, and Elixir. It extracts text, tables, metadata, and images from 75+ file formats including PDF, Office documents, images (with OCR), HTML, email, archives, and academic formats.\n\nUse this skill when writing code that:\n- Extracts text or metadata from documents\n- Performs OCR on scanned documents or images\n- Batch-processes multiple files\n- Configures extraction options (output format, chunking, OCR, language detection)\n- Implements custom plugins (post-processors, validators, OCR backends)\n\n## Installation\n\n### Python\n```bash\npip install kreuzberg\n# Optional OCR backends:\npip install kreuzberg[easyocr]    # EasyOCR\npip install kreuzberg[paddleocr]  # PaddleOCR\n```\n\n### Node.js\n```bash\nnpm install @kreuzberg/node\n```\n\n### Rust\n```toml\n# Cargo.toml\n[dependencies]\nkreuzberg = { version = \"4\", features = [\"tokio-runtime\"] }\n# features: tokio-runtime (required for sync + batch), pdf, ocr, chunking,\n#           embeddings, language-detection, keywords-yake, keywords-rake\n```\n\n### CLI\n```bash\n# Download from GitHub releases, or:\ncargo install kreuzberg-cli\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Python (Async)\n```python\nfrom kreuzberg import extract_file\n\nresult = await extract_file(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(result.content)       # extracted text\nprint(result.metadata)      # document metadata\nprint(result.tables)        # extracted tables\n```\n\n### Python (Sync)\n```python\nfrom kreuzberg import extract_file_sync\n\nresult = extract_file_sync(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(result.content)\n```\n\n### Node.js\n```typescript\nimport { extractFile } from ''@kreuzberg/node'';\n\nconst result = await extractFile(''document.pdf'');\nconsole.log(result.content);\nconsole.log(result.metadata);\nconsole.log(result.tables);\n```\n\n### Node.js (Sync)\n```typescript\nimport { extractFileSync } from ''@kreuzberg/node'';\n\nconst result = extractFileSync(''document.pdf'');\n```\n\n### Rust (Async)\n```rust\nuse kreuzberg::{extract_file, ExtractionConfig};\n\n#[tokio::main]\nasync fn main() -> kreuzberg::Result<()> {\n    let config = ExtractionConfig::default();\n    let result = extract_file(\"document.pdf\", None, &config).await?;\n    println!(\"{}\", result.content);\n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n### Rust (Sync) — requires `tokio-runtime` feature\n```rust\nuse kreuzberg::{extract_file_sync, ExtractionConfig};\n\nfn main() -> kreuzberg::Result<()> {\n    let config = ExtractionConfig::default();\n    let result = extract_file_sync(\"document.pdf\", None, &config)?;\n    println!(\"{}\", result.content);\n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n### CLI\n```bash\nkreuzberg extract document.pdf\nkreuzberg extract document.pdf --format json\nkreuzberg extract document.pdf --output-format markdown\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nAll languages use the same configuration structure with language-appropriate naming conventions.\n\n### Python (snake_case)\n```python\nfrom kreuzberg import (\n    ExtractionConfig, OcrConfig, TesseractConfig,\n    PdfConfig, ChunkingConfig,\n)\n\nconfig = ExtractionConfig(\n    ocr=OcrConfig(\n        backend=\"tesseract\",\n        language=\"eng\",\n        tesseract_config=TesseractConfig(psm=6, enable_table_detection=True),\n    ),\n    pdf_options=PdfConfig(passwords=[\"secret123\"]),\n    chunking=ChunkingConfig(max_chars=1000, max_overlap=200),\n    output_format=\"markdown\",\n)\n\nresult = await extract_file(\"document.pdf\", config=config)\n```\n\n### Node.js (camelCase)\n```typescript\nimport { extractFile, type ExtractionConfig } from ''@kreuzberg/node'';\n\nconst config: ExtractionConfig = {\n    ocr: { backend: ''tesseract'', language: ''eng'' },\n    pdfOptions: { passwords: [''secret123''] },\n    chunking: { maxChars: 1000, maxOverlap: 200 },\n    outputFormat: ''markdown'',\n};\n\nconst result = await extractFile(''document.pdf'', null, config);\n```\n\n### Rust (snake_case)\n```rust\nuse kreuzberg::{ExtractionConfig, OcrConfig, ChunkingConfig, OutputFormat};\n\nlet config = ExtractionConfig {\n    ocr: Some(OcrConfig {\n        backend: \"tesseract\".into(),\n        language: \"eng\".into(),\n        ..Default::default()\n    }),\n    chunking: Some(ChunkingConfig {\n        max_characters: 1000,\n        overlap: 200,\n        ..Default::default()\n    }),\n    output_format: OutputFormat::Markdown,\n    ..Default::default()\n};\n\nlet result = extract_file(\"document.pdf\", None, &config).await?;\n```\n\n### Config File (TOML)\n```toml\noutput_format = \"markdown\"\n\n[ocr]\nbackend = \"tesseract\"\nlanguage = \"eng\"\n\n[chunking]\nmax_chars = 1000\nmax_overlap = 200\n\n[pdf_options]\npasswords = [\"secret123\"]\n```\n\n```bash\n# CLI: auto-discovers kreuzberg.toml in current/parent directories\nkreuzberg extract doc.pdf\n# or explicit:\nkreuzberg extract doc.pdf --config kreuzberg.toml\nkreuzberg extract doc.pdf --config-json ''{\"ocr\":{\"backend\":\"tesseract\",\"language\":\"deu\"}}''\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\n### Python\n```python\nfrom kreuzberg import batch_extract_files, batch_extract_files_sync\n\n# Async\nresults = await batch_extract_files([\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.docx\", \"doc3.xlsx\"])\n\n# Sync\nresults = batch_extract_files_sync([\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.docx\"])\n\nfor result in results:\n    print(f\"{len(result.content)} chars extracted\")\n```\n\n### Node.js\n```typescript\nimport { batchExtractFiles } from ''@kreuzberg/node'';\n\nconst results = await batchExtractFiles([''doc1.pdf'', ''doc2.docx'']);\n```\n\n### Rust — requires `tokio-runtime` feature\n```rust\nuse kreuzberg::{batch_extract_file, ExtractionConfig};\n\nlet config = ExtractionConfig::default();\nlet paths = vec![\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.docx\"];\nlet results = batch_extract_file(paths, &config).await?;\n```\n\n### CLI\n```bash\nkreuzberg batch *.pdf --format json\nkreuzberg batch docs/*.docx --output-format markdown\n```\n\n## OCR\n\nOCR runs automatically for images and scanned PDFs. Tesseract is the default backend (native binding, no external install required).\n\n### Backends\n- **Tesseract** (default): Built-in native binding. All Tesseract languages supported.\n- **EasyOCR** (Python only): `pip install kreuzberg[easyocr]`. Pass `easyocr_kwargs={\"gpu\": True}`.\n- **PaddleOCR** (Python only): `pip install kreuzberg[paddleocr]`. Pass `paddleocr_kwargs={\"use_angle_cls\": True}`.\n- **Guten** (Node.js only): Built-in OCR backend via `GutenOcrBackend`.\n\n### Language Codes\n```python\nconfig = ExtractionConfig(ocr=OcrConfig(language=\"eng\"))       # English\nconfig = ExtractionConfig(ocr=OcrConfig(language=\"eng+deu\"))   # Multiple\nconfig = ExtractionConfig(ocr=OcrConfig(language=\"all\"))       # All installed\n```\n\n### Force OCR\n```python\nconfig = ExtractionConfig(force_ocr=True)  # OCR even if text is extractable\n```\n\n## ExtractionResult Fields\n\n| Field | Python | Node.js | Rust | Description |\n|-------|--------|---------|------|-------------|\n| Text content | `result.content` | `result.content` | `result.content` | Extracted text (str/String) |\n| MIME type | `result.mime_type` | `result.mimeType` | `result.mime_type` | Input document MIME type |\n| Metadata | `result.metadata` | `result.metadata` | `result.metadata` | Document metadata (dict/object/HashMap) |\n| Tables | `result.tables` | `result.tables` | `result.tables` | Extracted tables with cells + markdown |\n| Languages | `result.detected_languages` | `result.detectedLanguages` | `result.detected_languages` | Detected languages (if enabled) |\n| Chunks | `result.chunks` | `result.chunks` | `result.chunks` | Text chunks (if chunking enabled) |\n| Images | `result.images` | `result.images` | `result.images` | Extracted images (if enabled) |\n| Elements | `result.elements` | `result.elements` | `result.elements` | Semantic elements (if element_based format) |\n| Pages | `result.pages` | `result.pages` | `result.pages` | Per-page content (if page extraction enabled) |\n| Keywords | `result.keywords` | `result.keywords` | `result.keywords` | Extracted keywords (if enabled) |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Python\n```python\nfrom kreuzberg import (\n    extract_file_sync, KreuzbergError, ParsingError,\n    OCRError, ValidationError, MissingDependencyError,\n)\n\ntry:\n    result = extract_file_sync(\"file.pdf\")\nexcept ParsingError as e:\n    print(f\"Failed to parse: {e}\")\nexcept OCRError as e:\n    print(f\"OCR failed: {e}\")\nexcept ValidationError as e:\n    print(f\"Invalid input: {e}\")\nexcept MissingDependencyError as e:\n    print(f\"Missing dependency: {e}\")\nexcept KreuzbergError as e:\n    print(f\"Extraction failed: {e}\")\n```\n\n### Node.js\n```typescript\nimport {\n    extractFile, KreuzbergError, ParsingError,\n    OcrError, ValidationError, MissingDependencyError,\n} from ''@kreuzberg/node'';\n\ntry {\n    const result = await extractFile(''file.pdf'');\n} catch (e) {\n    if (e instanceof ParsingError) { /* ... */ }\n    else if (e instanceof OcrError) { /* ... */ }\n    else if (e instanceof ValidationError) { /* ... */ }\n    else if (e instanceof KreuzbergError) { /* ... */ }\n}\n```\n\n### Rust\n```rust\nuse kreuzberg::{extract_file, ExtractionConfig, KreuzbergError};\n\nlet config = ExtractionConfig::default();\nmatch extract_file(\"file.pdf\", None, &config).await {\n    Ok(result) => println!(\"{}\", result.content),\n    Err(KreuzbergError::Parsing(msg)) => eprintln!(\"Parse error: {msg}\"),\n    Err(KreuzbergError::Ocr(msg)) => eprintln!(\"OCR error: {msg}\"),\n    Err(e) => eprintln!(\"Error: {e}\"),\n}\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Python ChunkingConfig fields**: Use `max_chars` and `max_overlap`, NOT `max_characters` or `overlap`.\n2. **Rust extract_file signature**: Third argument is `&ExtractionConfig` (a reference), not `Option`. Use `&ExtractionConfig::default()` for defaults.\n3. **Rust feature gates**: `extract_file_sync`, `batch_extract_file`, and `batch_extract_file_sync` all require `features = [\"tokio-runtime\"]` in Cargo.toml.\n4. **Rust async context**: `extract_file` is async. Use `#[tokio::main]` or call from an async context.\n5. **CLI --format vs --output-format**: `--format` controls CLI output (text/json). `--output-format` controls content format (plain/markdown/djot/html).\n6. **Node.js extractFile signature**: `extractFile(path, mimeType?, config?)` — mimeType is the second arg (pass `null` to skip).\n7. **Python detect_mime_type**: The function for detecting from bytes is `detect_mime_type(data)`. For paths use `detect_mime_type_from_path(path)`.\n8. **Config file field names**: Use snake_case in TOML/YAML/JSON config files (e.g., `max_chars`, `max_overlap`, `pdf_options`).\n\n## Supported Formats (Summary)\n\n| Category | Extensions |\n|----------|-----------|\n| **PDF** | `.pdf` |\n| **Word** | `.docx`, `.odt` |\n| **Spreadsheets** | `.xlsx`, `.xlsm`, `.xlsb`, `.xls`, `.xla`, `.xlam`, `.xltm`, `.ods` |\n| **Presentations** | `.pptx`, `.ppt`, `.ppsx` |\n| **eBooks** | `.epub`, `.fb2` |\n| **Images** | `.png`, `.jpg`, `.jpeg`, `.gif`, `.webp`, `.bmp`, `.tiff`, `.tif`, `.jp2`, `.jpx`, `.jpm`, `.mj2`, `.jbig2`, `.jb2`, `.pnm`, `.pbm`, `.pgm`, `.ppm`, `.svg` |\n| **Markup** | `.html`, `.htm`, `.xhtml`, `.xml` |\n| **Data** | `.json`, `.yaml`, `.yml`, `.toml`, `.csv`, `.tsv` |\n| **Text** | `.txt`, `.md`, `.markdown`, `.djot`, `.rst`, `.org`, `.rtf` |\n| **Email** | `.eml`, `.msg` |\n| **Archives** | `.zip`, `.tar`, `.tgz`, `.gz`, `.7z` |\n| **Academic** | `.bib`, `.biblatex`, `.ris`, `.nbib`, `.enw`, `.csl`, `.tex`, `.latex`, `.typ`, `.jats`, `.ipynb`, `.docbook`, `.opml`, `.pod`, `.mdoc`, `.troff` |\n\nSee [references/supported-formats.md](references/supported-formats.md) for the complete format reference with MIME types.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nDetailed reference files for specific topics:\n\n- **[Python API Reference](references/python-api.md)** — All functions, config classes, plugin protocols, exact signatures\n- **[Node.js API Reference](references/nodejs-api.md)** — All functions, TypeScript interfaces, worker pool APIs\n- **[Rust API Reference](references/rust-api.md)** — All functions with feature gates, structs, Cargo.toml examples\n- **[CLI Reference](references/cli-reference.md)** — All commands, flags, config precedence, exit codes\n- **[Configuration Reference](references/configuration.md)** — TOML/YAML/JSON formats, auto-discovery, env vars, full schema\n- **[Supported Formats](references/supported-formats.md)** — All 75+ formats with file extensions and MIME types\n- **[Advanced Features](references/advanced-features.md)** — Plugins, embeddings, MCP server, API server, security limits\n- **[Other Language Bindings](references/other-bindings.md)** — Go, Ruby, Java, C#, PHP, Elixir, WASM, Docker\n\nFull documentation: https://docs.kreuzberg.dev\nGitHub: https://github.com/kreuzberg-dev/kreuzberg\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:32.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced document extraction capabilities from 75+ file formats","zh":"适用于需要高级文档提取功能的数据分析代理，从75+文件格式中提取数据","ja":"高度な文書抽出機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに適しています。75以上のファイル形式からデータを抽出","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 고급 문서 추출 기능을 제공하여 75가지 이상의 파일 형식에서 데이터를 추출","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan capacidades de extracción de documentos avanzadas de más de 75 formatos de archivo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant des capacités d''extraction de documents avancées à partir de 75+ formats de fichiers","de":"Perfekt für Data Analysis Agents, die erweiterte Dokumentextraktionsfunktionen aus 75+ Dateiformaten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de extração de documentos de 75+ formatos de arquivo","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются передовые возможности извлечения документов из 75+ форматов файлов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاستخراج المستندات من 75+ صيغ الملفات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text, metadata, and structured information from various file formats, including PDF, Office documents, and images with OCR, using native bindings for languages like Python, Rust, and Java","zh":"赋予代理从各种文件格式中提取文本、元数据和结构化信息的能力，包括PDF、Office文档和使用OCR的图像，使用Python、Rust和Java等语言的本地绑定","ja":"エージェントに、PDF、Office文書、OCRを使用した画像など、様々なファイル形式からテキスト、メタデータ、構造化情報を抽出する能力を与えます。Python、Rust、Javaなどの言語のネイティブバインディングを使用","ko":"에이전트에게 다양한 파일 형식에서 텍스트, 메타데이터 및 구조화된 정보를 추출하는 능력을 부여합니다. PDF, Office 문서 및 OCR을 사용한 이미지 등에서 Python, Rust, Java와 같은 언어의 네이티브 바인딩을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto, metadatos e información estructurada de varios formatos de archivo, incluyendo PDF, documentos de Office e imágenes con OCR, utilizando enlaces nativos para lenguajes como Python, Rust y Java","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte, des métadonnées et des informations structurées de divers formats de fichiers, y compris PDF, documents Office et images avec OCR, en utilisant des liaisons natives pour des langages comme Python, Rust et Java","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Text, Metadaten und strukturierte Informationen aus verschiedenen Dateiformaten zu extrahieren, einschließlich PDF, Office-Dokumenten und Bildern mit OCR, unter Verwendung von nativen Bindings für Sprachen wie Python, Rust und Java","pt":"Habilita agentes a extrair texto, metadados e informações estruturadas de vários formatos de arquivo, incluindo PDF, documentos do Office e imagens com OCR, usando vinculações nativas para linguagens como Python, Rust e Java","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст, метаданные и структурированную информацию из различных форматов файлов, включая PDF, документы Office и изображения с помощью OCR, используя родные привязки для языков, таких как Python, Rust и Java","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخراج النص والبيانات الوصفية والمعلومات المهيكلة من صيغ الملفات المختلفة، بما في ذلك PDF والوثائق المكتبية والصور مع OCR، باستخدام ربط أصلي للغات مثل Python وRust وJava"},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting tables and metadata from PDF documents","Performing OCR on scanned images and documents","Automating data ingestion from multiple file formats"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取表格和元数据","对扫描图像和文档执行OCR","从多个文件格式自动化数据摄取"],"ja":["PDF文書からテーブルとメタデータを抽出","スキャナーシステムの画像や文書に対してOCRを実行","複数のファイル形式からデータの取り込みを自動化"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 테이블 및 메타데이터 추출","스캔된 이미지 및 문서에서 OCR 수행","다중 파일 형식에서 데이터 수집 자동화"],"es":["Extraer tablas y metadatos de documentos PDF","Realizar OCR en imágenes y documentos escaneados","Automatizar la ingesta de datos de múltiples formatos de archivo"],"fr":["Extraire des tableaux et des métadonnées de documents PDF","Effectuer une OCR sur des images et des documents scannés","Automatiser l''ingestion de données de plusieurs formats de fichiers"],"de":["Tabellen und Metadaten aus PDF-Dokumenten extrahieren","OCR auf gescannten Bildern und Dokumenten durchführen","Datenübernahme aus mehreren Dateiformaten automatisieren"],"pt":["Extração de tabelas e metadados de documentos PDF","Realização de OCR em imagens e documentos digitalizados","Automação da ingestão de dados de vários formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Извлечение таблиц и метаданных из документов PDF","Выполнение OCR над отсканированными изображениями и документами","Автоматизация поглощения данных из нескольких форматов файлов"],"ar":["استخراج الجداول والبيانات الوصفية من وثائق PDF","تنفيذ OCR على الصور والوثائق الممسوحة ضوئيًا","توسيط استيعاب البيانات من صيغ الملفات المتعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires native bindings for supported languages","Limited to 75+ supported file formats"],"zh":["需要支持语言的本地绑定","仅限于75+支持的文件格式"],"ja":["サポートされている言語のネイティブバインディングが必要","75以上のサポートされているファイル形式に限定"],"ko":["지원 언어의 네이티브 바인딩이 필요","75가지 이상의 지원 파일 형식으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere enlaces nativos para lenguajes admitidos","Limitado a 75+ formatos de archivo admitidos"],"fr":["Nécessite des liaisons natives pour les langages pris en charge","Limité à 75+ formats de fichiers pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt native Bindings für unterstützte Sprachen","Begrenzt auf 75+ unterstützte Dateiformate"],"pt":["Requer vinculações nativas para linguagens suportadas","Limitado a 75+ formatos de arquivo suportados"],"ru":["Требует родных привязок для поддерживаемых языков","Ограничен 75+ поддерживаемыми форматами файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب ربطًا أصليًا للغات المدعومة","محدود بالصيغ 75+ المدعومة للملفات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4ec8fa91d9dd48bafcb32556b244d2198f6745dfadfad81fe33d33b8b3f8d316","qualityScore":50}');
