jsonと動的レンダリングを含む","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발은 워드프레스 블록을 생성하고 업데이트하는 과정으로 block.json과 동적 렌더링을 포함합니다","es":"wp-block-development es una habilidad para la creación y personalización de bloques de WordPress","fr":"wp-block-development est une compétence pour la création et la personnalisation de blocs WordPress","de":"wp-block-development ist eine Fähigkeit zur Erstellung und Anpassung von WordPress-Blöcken","pt":"Desenvolvimento de blocos WP é a criação de componentes reutilizáveis para WordPress","ru":"Разработка блоков WordPress - это создание повторно используемых компонентов для WordPress с ИИ Агентами","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP هو إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لشركة WordPress مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Creates and updates WordPress blocks using block.json","Supports dynamic rendering with render.php and render_callback","Manages block deprecations and migrations using deprecated versions","Utilizes build tooling like @wordpress/scripts and @wordpress/create-block","Troubleshoots common block issues, such as invalid or unsaved blocks"],"zh":["创建和更新WordPress区块","修改block.json文件","动态渲染支持","使用@wordpress/scripts和@wordpress/create-block构建工具","block.json的scripts、styles、supports、attributes和render属性支持"],"ja":["WordPressブロックの作成と更新","block.jsonファイルの編集","動的レンダリングのサポート","ビルドツール@wordpress/scriptsと@wordpress/create-blockの使用","block.jsonのscripts、styles、supports、attributesとrender属性のサポート"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 생성 및 업데이트","block.json 파일 수정","동적 렌더링 지원","빌드 툴 @wordpress/scripts와 @wordpress/create-block 사용","block.json의 scripts, styles, supports, attributes 및 render 속성 지원"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques y actualización de bloques existentes","Renderizado dinámico con render.php y render_callback","Herramientas de compilación con @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block","Soporte para block.json y atributos de bloques","Deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs et mise à jour de blocs existants","Rendu dynamique avec render.php et render_callback","Outils de construction avec @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block","Prise en charge de block.json et d''attributs de blocs","Dépréciations et migrations de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke und Aktualisierung bestehender Blöcke","Dynamisches Rendering mit render.php und render_callback","Build-Tools mit @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block","Unterstützung für block.json und Block-Attribute","Veraltete Versionen und Migrationen von Blöcken"],"pt":["Criação de blocos personalizados com `block.json`","Renderização dinâmica com `render.php` e `render_callback`","Suporte a `@wordpress/scripts` e `@wordpress/create-block`","Ferramentas de build para blocos com `wp-env`","Depreciações e migrações de blocos com versões obsoletas","Correção de erros de bloco inválido ou não salvo"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских блоков с `block.json` и ИИ Агентами","Динамическая отрисовка с `render.php` и `render_callback`","Поддержка `@wordpress/scripts` и `@wordpress/create-block`","Инструменты сборки для блоков с `wp-env`","Устаревшие версии блоков и миграции с ИИ Агентами","Исправление ошибок недопустимых или не сохраненных блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل مخصصة مع `block.json` وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ترndering الديناميكي مع `render.php` و `render_callback`","دعم `@wordpress/scripts` و `@wordpress/create-block`","أدوات بناء للكتل مع `wp-env`","إصدارات قديمة من الكتل والهجرة مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصحيح أخطاء الكتل غير صالح أو غير محفوظة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use wp-block-development","wp-block-development setup guide","wordpress block development tutorial","wp-block-development vs gutenberg","wp-block-development install","wordpress block creation","block.json management","wp-env setup"],"zh":["WordPress区块开发","AIエージェント工具","block.json修改","动态渲染","WordPress区块创建","WordPress区块更新","@wordpress/scripts","@wordpress/create-block"],"ja":["WordPressブロック開発","AIエージェント","block.json編集","動的レンダリング","WordPressブロック作成","WordPressブロック更新","@wordpress/scripts","@wordpress/create-block"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 개발","AI 에이전트 도구","block.json 수정","동적 렌더링","워드프레스 블록 생성","워드프레스 블록 업데이트","@wordpress/scripts","@wordpress/create-block"],"es":["wp-block-development","desarrollo de bloques de WordPress","renderizado dinámico","herramientas de compilación","block.json","atributos de bloques","deprecaciones de bloques","migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["wp-block-development","développement de blocs WordPress","rendu dynamique","outils de construction","block.json","attributs de blocs","dépréciations de blocs","migrations de blocs"],"de":["wp-block-development","Entwicklung von WordPress-Blöcken","dynamisches Rendering","Build-Tools","block.json","Block-Attribute","veraltete Versionen von Blöcken","Migrationen von Blöcken"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress block development","criação de blocos personalizados","renderização dinâmica","block.json","wp-env","desenvolvimento de plugins wordpress","temas wordpress personalizados","otimização de desempenho wordpress"],"ru":["разработка блоков wordpress","wordpress блок разработка","создание пользовательских блоков","динамическая отрисовка","block.json","wp-env","разработка плагинов wordpress","пользовательские темы wordpress","оптимизация производительности wordpress с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["تطوير الكتل wp","wordpress كتل تطوير","إنشاء كتل مخصصة","ترndering الديناميكي","block.json","wp-env","تطوير البرامج الإضافية لشركة wordpress","مظهر مخصص لشركة wordpress","تحسين أداء شركة wordpress مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Xilonz","repo":"gemini-wordpress-agent-skills","repoPath":"Xilonz/gemini-wordpress-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.290Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:00.801Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress Development Agents requiring efficient block creation and management using @wordpress/scripts and wp-env.","zh":"适用于需要使用@wordpress/scripts和wp-env进行高效块创建和管理的WordPress开发代理。","ja":"WordPress開発エージェントが@wordpress/scriptsとwp-envを使用して効率的にブロックを作成および管理する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"워드프레스 개발 에이전트가 @wordpress/scripts와 wp-env를 사용하여 효율적으로 블록을 생성하고 관리해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress que requieren una creación y gestión de bloques eficientes utilizando @wordpress/scripts y wp-env.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement WordPress nécessitant une création et une gestion de blocs efficaces en utilisant @wordpress/scripts et wp-env.","de":"Ideal für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente Blockerstellung und -verwaltung unter Verwendung von @wordpress/scripts und wp-env erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento WordPress que requerem criação e gerenciamento eficiente de blocos usando @wordpress/scripts e wp-env.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов разработки WordPress, которым требуется эффективное создание и управление блоками с использованием @wordpress/scripts и wp-env.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير WordPress الذين يتطلبون إنشاء وإدارة كتل بكفاءة باستخدام @wordpress/scripts و wp-env."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, update, and manage WordPress blocks, leveraging tools like @wordpress/scripts and wp-env for streamlined development, and handling block.json configurations, dynamic rendering, and deprecations with ease.","zh":"赋予代理创建、更新和管理WordPress块的能力，利用@wordpress/scripts和wp-env等工具简化开发，并轻松处理block.json配置、动态渲染和弃用问题。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressブロックを作成、更新、管理できるようにし、@wordpress/scriptsやwp-envなどのツールを使用して開発を簡素化し、block.jsonの構成、動的レンダリング、非推奨などの問題を容易に処理できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 워드프레스 블록을 생성, 업데이트 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @wordpress/scripts 및 wp-env와 같은 도구를 사용하여 개발을 간소화하고, block.json 구성, 동적 렌더링, 사용 중단 등의 문제를 쉽게 처리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, actualizar y gestionar bloques de WordPress, aprovechando herramientas como @wordpress/scripts y wp-env para un desarrollo optimizado, y manejando configuraciones de block.json, renderizado dinámico y deprecaciones con facilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de mettre à jour et de gérer des blocs WordPress, en exploitant des outils comme @wordpress/scripts et wp-env pour un développement optimisé, et en gérant les configurations de block.json, le rendu dynamique et les obsolèscences avec facilité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, WordPress-Blöcke zu erstellen, zu aktualisieren und zu verwalten, indem es Tools wie @wordpress/scripts und wp-env für ein optimiertes Entwicklungsumfeld nutzt und block.json-Konfigurationen, dynamisches Rendern und Veraltungen mühelos handhabt.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar, atualizar e gerenciar blocos do WordPress, aproveitando ferramentas como @wordpress/scripts e wp-env para um desenvolvimento simplificado, e lidando com configurações block.json, renderização dinâmica e descontinuações com facilidade.","ru":"Дает агентам возможность создавать, обновлять и управлять блоками WordPress, используя такие инструменты, как @wordpress/scripts и wp-env для оптимизированной разработки, а также с легкостью работать с конфигурациями block.json, динамическим рендерингом и устаревшими функциями.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحديث وإدارة كتل WordPress، والاستفادة من أدوات مثل @wordpress/scripts و wp-env لتطوير مبسط، والتعامل مع تكوينات block.json، والتصيير الديناميكي، والمهام المهملة بسهولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and updating custom WordPress blocks","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic rendering for blocks using render.php and render_callback"],"zh":["创建和更新自定义WordPress块","调试块失效和属性持久性问题","使用render.php和render_callback实现块的动态渲染"],"ja":["カスタムWordPressブロックの作成と更新","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性の問題のデバッグ","render.phpとrender_callbackを使用したブロックの動的レンダリングの実装"],"ko":["사용자 정의 워드프레스 블록 생성 및 업데이트","블록 무효화 및 속성 지속성 문제 디버깅","render.php 및 render_callback을 사용한 블록의 동적 렌더링 구현"],"es":["Creación y actualización de bloques personalizados de WordPress","Depuración de problemas de invalidación y persistencia de atributos de bloques","Implementación de renderizado dinámico para bloques mediante render.php y render_callback"],"fr":["Création et mise à jour de blocs WordPress personnalisés","Débogage des problèmes d''invalidation et de persistance d''attributs de blocs","Mise en œuvre d''un rendu dynamique pour les blocs à l''aide de render.php et render_callback"],"de":["Erstellung und Aktualisierung von benutzerdefinierten WordPress-Blöcken","Fehlerbehebung bei Block-Invalidierungs- und Attributpersistence-Problemen","Implementierung des dynamischen Renderns für Blöcke mithilfe von render.php und render_callback"],"pt":["Criar e atualizar blocos personalizados do WordPress","Depurar problemas de invalidação de blocos e persistência de atributos","Implementar renderização dinâmica para blocos usando render.php e render_callback"],"ru":["Создание и обновление пользовательских блоков WordPress","Отладка проблем с аннулированием блоков и сохранением атрибутов","Реализация динамического рендеринга для блоков с использованием render.php и render_callback"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحديث كتل WordPress المخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء إبطال الكتل ومشكلات استمرارية السمات","تنفيذ التصيير الديناميكي للكتل باستخدام render.php و render_callback"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment setup","wp-env and @wordpress/scripts dependency"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境设置","依赖wp-env和@wordpress/scripts"],"ja":["WordPress環境の設定が必要","wp-envと@wordpress/scriptsに依存"],"ko":["워드프레스 환경 설정이 필요","wp-env 및 @wordpress/scripts에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del entorno de WordPress","Dependencia de wp-env y @wordpress/scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''environnement WordPress","Dépendance de wp-env et @wordpress/scripts"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebungskonfiguration","Abhängigkeit von wp-env und @wordpress/scripts"],"pt":["Requer configuração do ambiente WordPress","Dependência do wp-env e @wordpress/scripts"],"ru":["Требует настройки среды WordPress","Зависимость от wp-env и @wordpress/scripts"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة WordPress","الاعتماد على wp-env و @wordpress/scripts"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0bb162e63148530991584df1ae8c06fbb33cd4d642c115101ef491e530d6705c","qualityScore":50}');
